{"concepts":[{"concept_id":"MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-003","label":"极限与连续","path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-003_极限与连续.md","sha256":"b09f10022c847ef0befa802134dce8e303cb7d0e7851453d7580f9aa8330291b"},{"concept_id":"MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-009","label":"数列极限","path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-009_数列极限.md","sha256":"63070af8bb1bf5d1d88df58a8c228852dee718469f92b03722c3e4fb0375d476"},{"concept_id":"MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-028","label":"反常积分","path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-028_反常积分.md","sha256":"b71a77b478bd19c90ae4594da6e674288875c68d4cbbc8c5a0d4f6944ba584cc"},{"concept_id":"MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-002","label":"定积分","path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-002_定积分.md","sha256":"c4c4027db908f16fd47d3b21005f7b386a705d7f0c39fa04f3cd601bf9a557c2"},{"concept_id":"MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-004","label":"等价无穷小","path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-004_等价无穷小.md","sha256":"2d59a29f29c12e666769f1992387e3ce8cd6252a81a29a7374b8fe83dee3a9e2"},{"concept_id":"MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-017","label":"幂指极限","path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-017_幂指极限.md","sha256":"62ff279b87c7b7845224ee73da3fabaa9d67338bb644e27de21d280e281daf67"},{"concept_id":"MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-138","label":"华里士公式","path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-138_华里士公式.md","sha256":"5a3dfc10cd07a81805b1e37450aae39f8da6db59015cbf5f9696b71ddd03e80a"}],"formal_card_path":"错题知识网络/错题卡/GS-316_1000题b组2.12.md","formal_card_sha256":"8d74ae1b8733972e5e6d66b52c1fae325cee6d47bae5e6d6ad04102fe757b719","formal_history":{"evidence_origin":"user_confirmed","mastery_history":[],"missed_action":"没有先识别 \\(1+x^2,\\ 0\\to+\\infty\\) 的正切换元入口，复发时还把两个积分的比值误写成一个积分","status":"待复做","wrong_history":["日期未归档 第1次错：旧导入时已记录关键换元 $x=\\tan t$ 没想到，华里士递推不熟，指数型极限入口轻忽。","2026-05-11 第2次错：仍没有识别出 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{(1+x^2)^n}$ 中的 $1+x^2$ 应优先用 $x=\\tan t$ 化为 $\\cos$ 幂积分；华里士公式不熟，导致不能快速得到 $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=1-\\frac1{2n}$ 并继续对数化求极限。","2026-06-09 第3次错：又没想到 $x=\\tan t$ 换元；直接算 $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}$，且因两积分上下限都是 $0\\to+\\infty$，错误地把比值放进一个积分号，算成 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{1+x^2}=\\frac\\pi2$。关键教训：两个积分的比值一般不能变成被积函数比值的积分。"],"wrong_point":"没有识别出反常积分中出现 $1+x^2$ 且区间为 $0\\to+\\infty$ 时，应优先用 $x=\\tan t$ 化成三角函数幂积分；同时华里士公式不熟，导致无法快速把 $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}$ 化成 $1-\\frac1{2n}$，后续指数型极限对数化也没有顺畅接上。2026-06-09 复发新增错点：因 $a_{n+1},a_n$ 上下限相同，错误地把比值 $\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}$ 放进一个积分号算成 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{1+x^2}=\\frac\\pi2$——两个积分的比值一般不能变成被积函数比值的积分，必须分别算出 $a_{n+1}$、$a_n$ 再作比。"},"formal_id":"GS-316","history_may_override_current":false,"knowledge":["极限与连续","数列极限","反常积分","定积分","等价无穷小","幂指极限","华里士公式"],"review_events":[],"scheduling":{"下次复习日期":"2026-05-12","复习单元ID":"MATH1-GS-WQ-GS316","复习状态":null,"当前间隔天数":1,"掌握度":2,"最近复发日期":"2026-05-11","证据阶段":null,"调度优先级":null,"连续延迟成功次数":null},"schema_version":"math-live-learning-state-v1","source_stamps":{"concept_directory":{"ctime_ns":1786566513464499949,"inode":43247501,"mtime_ns":1786566513464499949},"数学一回滚复习系统/复习单元.json":{"ctime_ns":1788330434969648987,"inode":189761659,"mtime_ns":1788330434961667258,"size":1582119},"数学一回滚复习系统/复习记录.jsonl":{"ctime_ns":1788328612946477885,"inode":34903167,"mtime_ns":1788328612946477885,"size":399399}},"source_version":"0514dd31599555240494f1d9ef556697af016239c60194ac0cf577abdfaa337f"}
